{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411320/extras/DicGif_Banner.gif?t=1744712457\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buy, sell, and upgrade the contents of your dice bag for<strong> endless</strong>\u00a0build combinations. Collect powerful artefacts which apply bonus effects to your dice rolls and perform high rolling combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Open rifts and defeat the enemies within, overcoming their unique abilities. Decide how to use your dice to block their attacks while chipping away at them with your own attacks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Open Otherworldly Portals\u00a0</strong>- Open rifts to other realms and battle the enemies within. Choose which realm is better suited to your build and destroy the enemy within. Enemies have unique abilities themed with their region, designed to put your builds to the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411320/extras/Unity_aebqc5Rcj6-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1744712457\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tons of Powerful Artefacts -</strong> Collect powerfully unique artefacts, rearranging them to maximise their effects. Multiply your rolls as high as possible, decimating enemies in a single hit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411320/extras/Unity_zGnPEN6wTy-ezgif.com-effects.gif?t=1744712457\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Infinite Dice Upgrades -</strong> Apply upgrades to your dice, increasing the amount of damage or shield that they provide. Modify your attacking dice to give you shield if you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dice Bags -</strong> Unlock many new dice bags, each with their own set of dice, abilities, and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3411320?t=1744712457","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3411320?t=1744712457","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411320/6a345256c269e5bc9c7c664c2f8c85ea8bf4c8d6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744712457","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411320/6a345256c269e5bc9c7c664c2f8c85ea8bf4c8d6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744712457","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411320/extras/DicGif_Banner.gif?t=1744712457\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buy, sell, and upgrade the contents of your dice bag for<strong> endless</strong>\u00a0build combinations. Collect powerful artefacts which apply bonus effects to your dice rolls and perform high rolling combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Open rifts and defeat the enemies within, overcoming their unique abilities. Decide how to use your dice to block their attacks while chipping away at them with your own attacks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Open Otherworldly Portals\u00a0</strong>- Open rifts to other realms and battle the enemies within. Choose which realm is better suited to your build and destroy the enemy within. Enemies have unique abilities themed with their region, designed to put your builds to the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411320/extras/Unity_aebqc5Rcj6-ezgif.com-vi